# A blocked creature stays blocked when what made it so changes (CR 509.1h), and a member removed from combat leaves its band
# (CR 702.22f). Bot1's Benalish Hero and Guerrilla Gorilla attack as a band; Bot2's Ulvenwald Oddity blocks the Hero, so it
# blocks the Gorilla too (CR 702.22h). In the declare blockers step Bot2 Bolts the Hero. The Gorilla is still blocked by the
# Oddity, deals its 2 to it and nothing to Bot2, and the Oddity, now blocking only the Gorilla, deals all 4 to it (CR 510.1d:
# no division is left to make, and the Gorilla has no banding to give one to Bot1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Benalish Hero
Guerrilla Gorilla
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Ulvenwald Oddity
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

